# 36. First Vertical Slice Standard

The first production-quality vertical slice should prove the architecture end to end.

Example:

```text
Mock or verified device
↓
Integration or provider
↓
Unified Device Registry
↓
Application use case
↓
Feature state
↓
AuraDeviceCard
↓
User command
↓
Confirmed or failed result
↓
Diagnostics event
```

The slice must include:

- Loading state
- Success state
- Offline state
- Error recovery
- Accessibility
- Unit tests
- At least one integration-level test

A visually complete screen backed by fake disconnected logic does not satisfy this standard.

